# Instagram live feed for the homepage carousel (build-time, optional).
# If unset, the carousel falls back to the static status-feed automatically.
#
# How to get a long-lived token:
#   1. https://developers.facebook.com → create an app
#   2. Add the "Instagram" product → set up "Instagram Login"
#   3. Connect your IG account, then generate a long-lived user access token
#      (valid ~60 days)
#   4. Paste it below (and set the same var in the Cloudflare Pages build env)
#
# Refresh before it expires (keeps it valid another 60 days):
#   curl "https://graph.instagram.com/refresh_access_token?grant_type=ig_refresh_token&access_token=YOUR_TOKEN"
#
# Note: posts only update when the site rebuilds — schedule a periodic
# Cloudflare deploy (e.g. daily) to keep the feed fresh and the token warm.

INSTAGRAM_TOKEN=
